<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - GEMEX started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - GEMEX started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Caspian Securities said on Monday it had initiated coverage of Grupo Embotellador de Mexico with a market performer rating.</p>
<p>-- Analysts Martin Lara and Pablo Ruiz wrote in a report, &quot;Although we expect the operating performance to improve in 1997, we believe that management turnover, high earnings multiples and uncertainty over PepsiCo Inc's strategy for Latin America will continue to cause the stock price to lag that of its main competitors.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The 12-month target price on the stock is 14.90 pesos.</p>
<p>-- Ian Simpson, Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
